== Effects ==
* {{R|Shop}}s and {{R|Black Market}}s now sell [[familiar]]s instead of the usual item selection.
** The familiars are chosen from the [[Baby Shop (Item Pool)|Baby Shop item pool]].
** While holding the Adoption Papers, the familiars are discounted to 10 coins. If the papers are dropped, they cost 15 coins.

== Notes ==
* A shop that has already been entered will not have its item selection changed, nor will dropping the papers revert them to normal.
* In [[Greed Mode]], only the shop pool item is replaced with a familiar and discounted.
** This also applies to all shop pool items when playing as {{C|Tainted Keeper}}. Familiars spawned from the Treasure Room pool remain unaffected.
* Familiars that appear in both the Shop pool and Baby Shop pool ({{I|Buddy in a Box}}, {{I|King Baby}}, etc) will be discounted by Adoption Papers even if the shop was visited before the trinket was held.
* After [[Baby Shop (Item Pool)|Baby Shop item pool]] is exhausted, items from normal [[Shop (Item Pool)|shop pool]] will be generated again in shops.
** Items generated by this will still discount to 10 coins.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{I|Mom's Box}}: Familiars are always on sale. {{dlc|r+}} Shops will also be able to sell {{p|Soul of Lilith}} if isaac has both {{A|Golden Trinket|n}} and {{i|Mom's Box|n}}.
* {{i|Steam Sale}}: Both of the discounts stack, selling familiars for 5 cents.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Chaos}}: Chaos takes priority in item selection. However, items will still be discounted.
* {{i|Eden's Soul}} / {{i|Mystery Gift}}: Ignores the effect of Adoption Papers, spawning items from the [[Shop (Item Pool)|Shop pool]] if used there.
* {{i|Flip}}: The ghostly items will be from the Shop pool.
* {{i|Glitched Crown}}: While one of the items will come from the Baby Shop pool, the other 4 items cycled between will come from the regular Shop pool, all of which still discounted at 10 coins.
* {{i|Keeper's Box}}: Does not affect Keeper's Box' items, meaning both familiars and shop items can be purchased in tandem over the course of a run.
* {{i|Member Card}} / {{i|The Stairway}}: The extra shops are unaffected by Adoption Papers.

